# The engineer line's own append-only table, under the same rule the root
# .gitattributes states for `lna/data/*.jsonl`: git's line-based text merge can
# reorder, interleave or duplicate independently-appended JSONL lines, so a
# cross-line merge of this file must fail loudly (a real conflict) rather than
# silently interleave. Trajectory rows are combined -- if they ever need to be --
# by an explicit tool, never by a git content merge. See engineer/00-CHARTER.md
# §3.2.
data/*.jsonl -merge -diff
